# cat through the FAT (roadmap os-server.md P9): a small file, a file in
# two pieces (B:\FRAG.TXT: clusters 3-4 and 6-7), and a file of four 8 KB
# clusters (C:\NUMBERS.TXT).
program: sh
keys: cat c:/docs/hello.txt\ncat b:frag.txt\ncat c:/numbers.txt\n
match: contains
timeout: 120
---
/mnt/rx286$ cat c:/docs/hello.txt
Hello from C:\DOCS.
/mnt/rx286$ cat b:frag.txt
line 01 of FRAG.TXT, a file in two pieces on B:
line 32 of FRAG.TXT, a file in two pieces on B:
line 33 of FRAG.TXT, a file in two pieces on B:
line 64 of FRAG.TXT, a file in two pieces on B:
/mnt/rx286$ cat c:/numbers.txt
line 0001 of C:\NUMBERS.TXT
line 0500 of C:\NUMBERS.TXT
line 1000 of C:\NUMBERS.TXT
/mnt/rx286$
